# skills/ is INTENTIONALLY tracked (skills/skills-catalog.md is part of the
# repo's agent tooling contract) — do not ignore the directory itself.
# Machine-local agent-skill SYMLINKS must never be tracked, though: the owner
# links these names against a sibling clone of mattpocok-skills, and committed
# links that resolve outside the project root crash `next build` on that
# machine (Turbopack panic: "FileSystemPath … leaves the filesystem root" —
# Tailwind v4 auto-detection follows them; dangling links pass CI, so the
# crash only shows on the owner's box). Contract-pinned by
# src/regression/repo-hygiene.test.ts. Recreate locally with:
#   ln -s /Home1/project/mattpocok-skills/skills/<group>/<name> skills/<name>
/skills/ask-matt
/skills/diagnosing-bugs
/skills/git-guardrails-claude-code
/skills/grill-me
/skills/grilling
/skills/handoff
/skills/improve-codebase-architecture
/skills/migrate-to-shoehorn
/skills/scaffold-exercises
/skills/setup-pre-commit
/skills/tdd
/skills/teach
/skills/to-questionnaire
/skills/wait-what
/skills/writing-for-agents
